# Absolute origin of the Python API.
#
# Leave unset for web development: Vite proxies /api and /uploads to :3001 on
# the same origin. Set it for any build that runs on a device or in the
# Simulator, where there is no proxy — a LAN address for a local backend, or
# the deployed host. The backend must allow CORS for capacitor://localhost.
#
# VITE_API_ORIGIN=http://192.168.1.10:3001
